Slade is a human soldier of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], the crew of a ship from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]]. He is barely eighteen, too young by his own people's reckoning for the work, and wears the service's close-cut uniform, a suit more than a soldier's kit, marked with a sixteen-pointed star. He gives his rank as left-handed junior grade in Jenslade.

He was aboard the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid|Hesperid]] when it was run into the ascending Thessian [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/Esoterica|Gremory]], and he was not trained for any of it. When the Party reached the ship's survivors through a speaker grate, Slade was the one who answered, frightened and without orders. After the rescue he stood apart with his arms around his own legs, staring into the middle distance. He does not pretend to be a fighter.
